<title>INDIA: India approves 40 pct Thai stake in private bank.</title>
<headline>India approves 40 pct Thai stake in private bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian cabinet on Friday approved a the acquisition of up to 40 percent of the private Catholic Syrian Bank Ltd by Thailand's Siam Vidya Group (SVG).</p>
<p>A Cabinet Committee on Foreign Investment statement said Siam Vidya will be expected to contribute one billion rupees ($28 million) in capital. It gave no other details. ($1 = 35.80 rupees)</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
